# held/props/lamppole: the lamplighter's pole for the Lamp posture (PROPS, P2b): a long dark pole raised to the lamp, a
# brass hook and a lit taper at its head. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Around the raised right grip, anchored on the right
# shoulder; it stands past the head, its taper the brightest pixel.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held lamppole
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

